---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="stack">
    <section class="text">
      <p>
        I'm a mechanical engineer who likes owning a part from the first sketch to the finished piece. I design in
        SolidWorks, then build: waterjet cutting, press brake forming, 3D printing and assembly.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm pursuing an M.S. in Mechanical Engineering at Columbia University, focused on design for manufacturing.
        Before Columbia, I earned my B.S. at NYU, passed the FE exam, and spent two years as a project engineer on
        building restoration projects in New York. This past summer I interned at EngiWorks in Puerto Rico, designing
        sheet metal parts for clients and reverse engineering production-line components.
      </p>
      <p>I'm looking for a Summer 2027 internship in mechanical or product design.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="label">Experience</h2>
      <dl class="rows">
        <dt>2026</dt>
        <dd>EngiWorks<br /><span class="muted">Mechanical Engineer Intern · Caguas, PR</span></dd>
        <dt>2024–26</dt>
        <dd>Structural Preservation Systems<br /><span class="muted">Project Engineer · New York, NY</span></dd>
        <dt>2023</dt>
        <dd>Collins Aerospace<br /><span class="muted">Project Engineer Intern · Aguadilla, PR</span></dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="label">Education</h2>
      <dl class="rows">
        <dt>2026–27</dt>
        <dd>Columbia University<br /><span class="muted">M.S. Mechanical Engineering</span></dd>
        <dt>2020–24</dt>
        <dd>New York University, Tandon<br /><span class="muted">B.S. Mechanical Engineering · FE exam passed 2025</span></dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="label">Tools</h2>
      <p class="text">
        SolidWorks (parts, sheet metal, assemblies, drawings), ANSYS, FEA, 3D printing, CNC waterjet, CNC router,
        laser cutting, sheet metal forming, Arduino, Python.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .label {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .rows {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6.5em minmax(0, 1fr);
    row-gap: 14px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .rows dt {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .rows dd {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
